# Vendored third-party code.
#
# programs/doom/doomgeneric/ is the doomgeneric port of the id Software DOOM
# engine (GPLv2), vendored so that "make doom" works from a fresh clone. It is
# not our code, and at ~1.6 MB it is roughly half of all the C in the
# repository -- without this marker GitHub reports the project as majority C
# rather than Ada.
#
# GitHub's Linguist auto-detects vendored code only under conventional paths
# such as vendor/ or third_party/, which this is not, so it has to be declared.
programs/doom/doomgeneric/** linguist-vendored
